### SCIM Patch User
PATCH http://localhost:8180/realms/scim/scim/v2/Users/c0093fc6-ff58-4fc1-b21f-e1a3a079ad92
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "Operations": [
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "emails[type eq \"work\"].value",
      "value": "eduardo@aufderhar.info"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "emails[type eq \"work\"].primary",
      "value": true
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "value": {
        "active": true,
        "displayName": "TJDKQZWRZLMY",
        "title": "XSKHHDCYQTET",
        "preferredLanguage": "gl-ES",
        "name.givenName": "Amanda",
        "name.familyName": "Amina",
        "name.formatted": "Camille",
        "name.middleName": "Marianna",
        "name.honorificPrefix": "Hermina",
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:employeeNumber": "1ZYXMRCFHHPLX",
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:department": "GOPYEHUILMXN",
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:costCenter": "SPDPBUTMJQJW",
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:organization": "KVJDIZIXYDRR",
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:division": "UYIBLQWEVUOF",
        "userType": "TIKZYDLAGUYB",
        "nickName": "GAIECAHHZPBF",
        "locale": "SHNEIRJLMHGS",
        "timezone": "America/Eirunepe",
        "profileUrl": "HCDCICUAOUWZ"
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemas": [
    "urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:PatchOp"
  ]
}

### SCIM Query User
GET http://localhost:8180/realms/scim/scim/v2/Users?filter=userName eq "amos.marvin@bruen.com"
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### SCIM Get User
GET http://localhost:8180/realms/scim/scim/v2/Users/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### SCIM Get Schemas
GET http://localhost:8180/realms/scim/scim/v2/Schemas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### SCIM Get Schema
GET http://localhost:8180/realms/scim/scim/v2/Schemas/urn:keycloak:params:scim:schemas:extension:client:1.0:OIDC
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### SCIM Create Client
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/scim/scim/v2/OIDCClients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "schemas": [
    "urn:keycloak:params:scim:schemas:extension:client:1.0:OIDC"
  ],
  "clientId": "foo"
}
